Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.00,Credit,,0,0,0,,字幕制作：测试样本组
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天怎么这么早就起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.20,SEC,,0,0,0,,Why are you up so early today?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.00,ZH,,0,0,148,,我睡不着 干脆起来煮点咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep,\Nso I figured I'd make some coffee.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.80,ZH,,0,0,148,,你要不要也来一杯 我煮了一大壶\N够我们两个人喝一整个上午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.80,SEC,,0,0,0,,Do you want a cup too? I made a big pot,\Nenough for both of us to drink all morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,好啊 - 加不加糖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,- Sure. - Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.50,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（水壶鸣响）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:17.60,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[kettle whistling]
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.50,ZH,,0,0,148,,楼下那家店的新iPhone壳打八折\N我昨天顺手买了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.50,SEC,,0,0,0,,The shop downstairs has phone cases\Nat 20% off, so I grabbed one yesterday.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,ZH,,0,0,148,,一共是128.50元 比网上便宜了差不多30块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,It came to 128.50 in total,\Nabout 30 cheaper than online.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.00,ZH,,0,0,148,,说明书上写着去\Nhttps://example.com/help/setup?step=2 下载App
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,The manual says to go\Nto https://example.com/help/setup?step=2 and get the app.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.50,0:00:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,营业时间 9:00-21:00
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.10,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}OPEN 9 AM - 9 PM
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.50,0:00:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实我一直想跟你说 下个月我\N可能要搬到离公司近一点的地方去住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:35.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,I might move closer to work next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.20,SEC,,0,0,0,,There's something I've been meaning to tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.00,ZH,,0,0,148,,嗯 每天通勤两个小时 实在是太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Two hours of commuting\Nevery day is just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ 窗外的雨一直下 ♪\N{\rLyrics_EN}♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.80,ZH,,0,0,148,,那周末我帮你一起看房子吧\N顺便去吃那家我们一直说要去的面馆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.80,SEC,,0,0,0,,Then let me help you look at places this weekend,\Nand we can finally try that noodle place we keep talking about.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 就这么说定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.50,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[door closes]
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,她走了以后，房间突然安静了下来。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,喂？我在家 你到楼下了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.00,SEC,,0,0,0,,Hello? I'm home. Are you downstairs?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我马上下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.50,SEC,,0,0,0,,I'll come down.
